OL,3,AMyanmar committed genocide against its
OL,4,ARohingya minority, UN's top court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2017, a military crackdown killed
OL,7,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more
OL,8,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority
OL,9,FMyanmar for neighbouring Bangladesh
OL,11,FMyanmar had denied genocide in the case
OL,12,Fbrought by The Gambia and said its
OL,13,Fforces were responding to attacks by
OL,14,Farmed groups
